# Mongolian Whisper API — Clean Git Config
# =========================================

# Ignore everything by default
*

# ✅ Keep these important files
!app.py
!requirements.txt
!render.yaml
!runtime.txt

# ✅ Keep your model folder (MN_Whisper_Small_CT2)
